Package: usgslpc
Title: AOI Driven USGS LiDAR Metrics
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Josh", "Erickson", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Resolve USGS LiDAR sources for polygonal areas of interest,
    normalize point clouds, calculate lidar.metrics products, and retain
    reproducible provenance.
